38913477,"Artificial Intelligence, Digital Self, and the “Best Interests” Problem",10.1080/15265161.2024.2353028,,,,,,Jeffrey Todd Berger,W4399963331,"In their target article, “A Personalized Patient Preference Predictor for Substituted Judgments in Healthcare: Technically Feasible and Ethically Desirable,” Earp et al. (2024) discuss ways in whic...",W2121629556; W2129671918; W2135818960; W2551894950; W2569709525; W2607324773; W2789483976; W2791396906; W3003572479; W4390919125,7,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
