34920542,Will Artificial Intelligence Replace Nurses? A Debate,10.3233/SHTI210740,,,,,,Laura-Maria Peltonen; Lisiane Pruinelli; Adrienne Lewis; Lorraine Block; Maxim Topaz; Hanna von Gerich; Charlene Ronquillo,W4200015044,Technological development has enabled Artificial Intelligence (AI) to better support health care delivery and nursing. The need for nurses to be involved and steer the development and implementation of AI in health care is recognized. A 60-minute scientific debate is organized to explore if AI will replace nursing.,W2990768863; W6819490522,4,2021,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
