40162840,Artificial Intelligence: Potential for the Future,10.1097/NCM.0000000000000790,,,,,,Suzanne K. Powell,W4409000416,"Artificial Intelligence (AI) is here to stay. Fear and reservations still abound; however, many large institutions are developing and researching new treatments for diseases that may help our patients/clients in the near future.",,0,2025,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
38899492,Artificial intelligence: help or hindrance in solving the reproducibility crisis?,10.1080/07366205.2024.2355776,,,,,,Jenny Straiton,W4399862098,Science is in the midst of a reproducibility crisis and the integration of artificial intelligence into scientific research has only compounded the problem; yet could the technology hold the solution to its own problems?[Formula: see text].,W585341442; W2144981148; W2406493898; W3013681994; W3023516546; W3025948831; W3119527628; W3136933888; W4318577410; W4380290489; W4382061075; W4386151868; W4389338955,4,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
