31786999,The role of artificial intelligence and machine learning in predicting orthopaedic outcomes,10.1302/0301-620X.101B12.BJJ-2019-0850.R1,,,,,,Lee E Bayliss; Luke D. Jones,W2992665713,"This annotation briefly reviews the history of artificial intelligence and machine learning in health care and orthopaedics, and considers the role it will have in the future, particularly with reference to statistical analyses involving large datasets. Cite this article: Bone Joint J 2019;101-B:1476–1478",W188378287; W2733840449; W2735575534; W2785863263; W2790940592; W2802561155; W2901954625; W3198350258,51,2019,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
