33111408,Addressing the challenges of artificial intelligence in medicine,10.1111/imj.15017,,,,,,Marcus Smith; Rachael C. Heath Jeffery,W3095747430,"The application of artificial intelligence in medicine, particularly in relation to screening and diagnosis of disease through imaging analysis, will have a profound impact over the next decade. This communication discusses regulatory challenges that should be considered by physicians and how potential issues may be mitigated using a collaborative approach, drawing on the combined expertise of relevant stakeholders.",W151664814; W648990582; W842190952; W2009707259; W2529153069; W2548723212; W2557738935; W2581082771; W2587122088; W2595668780; W2605253636; W2613268084; W2772246530; W2772723798; W2783063799; W2796849507; W2899635607; W2901946084; W2904251400; W2904684392; W2911526543; W2922512202; W2939466230; W2949122205; W2964696298; W2982580298; W2998175747; W6734660512; W6756517570; W7073827954,18,2020,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
