25163864,AI and Cognitive Science: The Past and Next 30 Years,10.1111/j.1756-8765.2010.01083.x,,,,,,Kenneth D. Forbus,W1972829642,"Artificial Intelligence (AI) is a core area of Cognitive Science, yet today few AI researchers attend the Cognitive Science Society meetings. This essay examines why, how AI has changed over the last 30 years, and some emerging areas of potential interest where AI and the Society can go together in the next 30 years, if they choose.",W132298708; W619898397; W1485173372; W1505640990; W1527110714; W1977970897; W2075725716; W2081580037; W2097785963; W2098138601; W2098723043; W2107658650; W2114804859; W2114977273; W2115792525; W2118434854; W2119017831; W2126539437; W2128103053; W2152909313; W2156979131; W2161631176; W2612037075; W4213199944; W4252743921; W4285719527; W6631446989,46,2010,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
