41307473,"AI in modern dentistry: Hype, hope, or real transformation?",10.17219/dmp/211356,,,,,,Anna Maria Paradowska-Stolarz,W4416758839,"Artificial intelligence (AI) shows significant potential in supporting development and management in everyday dental practice; however, significant challenges, limitations and uncertainties remain.",,0,2025,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
