30659443,How to Prepare Prospective Psychiatrists in the Era of Artificial Intelligence,10.1007/s40596-019-01025-x,,,,,,Jung Won Kim; Kathryn L. Jones; Eugene D'Angelo,W2909908543,"Some of the ways that emerging technological advances, including artificial intelligence, have impacted the field of psychiatry are discussed and how educators can prepare trainee psychiatrists in best practices are discussed.",W1159185915; W1872649730; W2001771035; W2019958174; W2099386544; W2145482038; W2149883528; W2623779865; W2791625037; W2810500942; W2888327795; W2894319790; W2896340320; W2897907947,30,2019,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
30557239,"Artificial Intelligence: Have You Met Your New Friends; Siri, Cortona, Alexa, Dot, Spot, and Puck",10.1097/BRS.0000000000002913,,,,,,James N. Weinstein,W2898154467,"Dartmouth Hitchcock Medical Center, Lebanon, NH, Kellogg School of Business, Northwestern University. Address correspondence and reprint requests to James N. Weinstein, DO, MS, Dartmouth Hitchcock Medical Center, Lebanon, NH; E-mail: [email protected] Received 15 October, 2018 Accepted 15 October, 2018 The manuscript submitted does not contain information about medical device(s)/drug(s). No funds were received in support of this work. Dr. Weinstein is currently a Sr. V.P. at Microsoft for Health care, responsible for Innovation and Health Equity; Clinical Professor at the Kellogg School of Business, Northwestern University and TUCK Business at Dartmouth. He is on the Board of Imagine Care, Intermountain Health System and the Max Planck Institute.",W1536125627; W2774800586; W3045969850,3,2018,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
29342690,What can the brain teach us about building artificial intelligence?,10.1017/S0140525X17000140,,,,,,Dileep George,W2768835331,"Lake et al. offer a timely critique on the recent accomplishments in artificial intelligence from the vantage point of human intelligence and provide insightful suggestions about research directions for building more human-like intelligence. Because we agree with most of the points they raised, here we offer a few points that are complementary.",W1595026169; W2010124835; W2109917918; W2120079537; W2123335490; W2145339207,4,2017,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
