35562461,Can artificial intelligence replace humans?,10.1038/s41415-022-4276-9,,,,,,Paul Hellyer,W4280554374,Using a two-step process – one CNN to identify areas prone to caries as regions of interest (ROI) and another to identify caries within the ROI – the system demonstrated promising results and a greater accuracy than previous studies.,,0,2022,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
