18592055,"[I, Robot: artificial intelligence, uniqueness and self-consciousness]",,,,,,,,,"The cinematographic version of the science fiction classical book by Isaac Asimov (I, Robot) is used as a starting point, from the Artificial Intelligence perspective, in order to analyze what it is to have a self. Uniqueness or the exchange impossibility and the continuity of being one self are put forward to understand the movie's characters as well as the possibilities of feeling self conscious.",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
