42483378,“Hallucinations” of artificial intelligence tools misleading patients and families,10.4103/jfmpc.jfmpc_262_26,,,,,,Zvi Weizman,W7165203416,"Large Language Models offer significant benefits in healthcare, including guidance for patients and families. One of the risks associated with these tools is the presentation of inaccurate information, known as ""Hallucinations."" This study highlights three cases where these tools misled patients and families by providing false information, which could cause harm. Therefore, physicians must review and verify any Artificial intelligence (AI)-generated content, as these tools cannot reliably differentiate between accurate and false information.",W3092794643; W4288712110; W4387950352; W4399805847; W4408132507; W4412853478; W4414760181,0,2026,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
40230663,From Text to Data: Automatically Extracting Data From Catheterization Reports Using Generative Artificial Intelligence,10.1016/j.jscai.2024.102242,,,,,,Yuval Barak‐Corren; Mudit Gupta; Jessica A Tang; Christopher L. Smith; Ryan M. Callahan; Yoav Dori; Jonathan J. Rome; Matthew John Gillespie; Michael Liam O'Byrne,W4402194404,"Documentation of critical information for pediatric/congenital catheterization procedures is frequently communicated through paragraphs of unstructured text. Extracting this information incurs a considerable investment of time and effort for review of charts and risks introducing error during manual transcription of data.1 The burden is magnified in multisite studies because reporting styles and jargon may vary. Automating data collection using generative artificial intelligence (AI) tools, such as ChatGPT (OpenAI), Med-PaLM (Google), LLaMA (Meta Platforms), and others, has the potential to not only make this process more efficient by reducing time used for manual chart review but also to improve the accuracy of the data collected.",W2999536597; W3039053697; W3210471448; W4396553888; W4405281112; W6854462480,3,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
