40973585,Artificial Intelligence in Gastroenterology.,10.1016/j.dld.2025.09.001,,,,,,Tommy Rizkala; Cesare Hassan,W4414380615,"Despite several advances in the oncological management of colorectal cancer (CRC), there still remains a lacuna in the treatment strategy, which differs from center to center and on the philosophy of the treating clinician that is not without bias. Personalized treatment is essential for the treatment of CRC to achieve better long-term outcomes and to reduce morbidity. Surgery has an important role to play in the treatment. Surgical treatment of CRC is decided based on clinical parameters and investigations and hence likely to have judgmental errors. Artificial intelligence has been reported to be useful in the surveillance, diagnosis, treatment, and follow-up with accuracy in several malignancies. However, it is still evolving and yet to be established in surgical decision making in CRC. It is not only useful preoperatively but also intraoperatively. Artificial intelligence helps to rectify the human surgical decision when clinical data and radiological and laboratory parameters are fed into the computer and may guide correct surgical treatment.",W4379389119; W4386781106; W4389312093; W4389328098; W4389850946; W4391510631; W4392961515; W4394980194; W4396776434; W4398131119; W4400244780; W4402563291; W4403591794; W4407163900,0,2025,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
40638096,Artificial intelligence for risk prediction in transcatheter heart valve interventions,10.1080/14779072.2025.2533241,,,,,,Karim Jamhour-Chelh; Dabit Arzamendi; Lluís Asmarats,W4412161341,1. Transcatheter heart valve (THV) interventions have revolutionized the management of structural heart diseases. The expansion of transcatheter aortic valve replacement (TAVR) over the past two de...,W2974348951; W3049097976; W3197888877; W4229057540; W4327739783; W4377030063; W4386577616; W4387673823; W4390452653; W4391051633; W4399246651; W4399761656; W4401543630; W4401965033; W4403693357; W4404546915; W4409628200,1,2025,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
