40115409,Harnessing artificial intelligence for identifying conflicts of interest in research,10.5662/wjm.v15.i1.98376,,,,,,Abdulqadir J. J. Nashwan,W4402947540,"This editorial explores the transformative potential of artificial intelligence (AI) in identifying conflicts of interest (COIs) within academic and scientific research. By harnessing advanced data analysis, pattern recognition, and natural language processing techniques, AI offers innovative solutions for enhancing transparency and integrity in research. This editorial discusses how AI can automatically detect COIs, integrate data from various sources, and streamline reporting processes, thereby maintaining the credibility of scientific findings.",W3144293453; W3155464240; W4360777571; W4393929877; W4396232287,4,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
