33574001,Can artificial intelligence help create racial equality in the USA?,10.1016/S2589-7500(21)00023-6,,,,,,The Lancet Digital Health,W4205691169,"Barack Obama once said that Black History Month was about “taking an unvarnished look at the past so we can create a better future”. Ideally, artificial intelligence (AI) in medicine should do just that, by analysing data from the past to improve health-care outcomes of patients in the future. However, experts have warned that AI models can instead replicate and amplify systematic racism. How can we better leverage AI to create racial equality in health?",,6,2021,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
