39589757,Artificial intelligence and radiomics in desmoid-type fibromatosis: are we there yet?,10.1080/14796694.2024.2418796,,,,,,Tania Moussa; Tarek Assi; Ines Kasraoui; Samy Ammari; Corinne Balleyguier,W4404744539,,W1989604862; W2043132446; W2073052893; W2386558879; W2587297900; W2986910815; W3004209283; W3023189324; W3084419403; W3091075868; W3094742237; W3096257175; W4220768105; W4240625271; W4293795461; W4390187156; W4392457113; W4402559439,1,2025,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
39364780,Formation of the Canadian Artificial Intelligence and Mass Spectrometry for systems biology (CAN-AIMS) consortium,10.1080/14789450.2024.2413441,,,,,,Jennifer Geddes‐McAlister; Arnaud Droit,W4403134912,"1. Over 75 infectious diseases are caused by bacterial, fungal, and viral pathogens, as well as parasites, with control guidelines recognized by the Public Health Agency of Canada [1]. These diseas...",W2133815101; W2294532941; W2536322725; W2978053195; W4220990424; W4291583104; W4367174641; W4377940063; W4396671070; W4401176280; W4401580310,1,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
