40134040,"Artificial Intelligence’s Ongoing Expansion in Pharmacy Practice: Opportunities, Challenges, and Unknowns",10.4140/TCP.n.2025.194,,,,,,Leigh Davitian,W4408832218,"Artificial intelligence (AI) is playing an increasingly pivotal role in revolutionizing the health care industry. From personalized medicine, physician practices, hospitals, drug development, and pharmacy operations, AI is reshaping nearly every facet of health care. In essence, AI is reinventing and revitalizing modern health care by enabling machines to predict, understand, learn, and take independent action. This article explores the evolving role of AI and its impact on health care-particularly on pharmacy practice-and aims to provide a broad overview while highlighting the opportunities, challenges, and some unknowns.",,0,2025,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
