41792041,“Keep the Human Touch”: Exploring Perspectives of Older Adults on the Use of Artificial Intelligence ( AI ) in Healthcare,10.1111/jgs.70366,,,,,,Julie N Thai; Hao Sun; Heather Z. Mui; Katherine Ward,W7134124478,Funding for this study was provided by the Stanford Primary Care and Population Health (PCPH) Seed Grant. All authors acknowledge that no artificial intelligence was used in the preparation of this manuscript. The authors declare no conflicts of interest. Table S1: Demographics of study participants (N = 16). Please note: The publisher is not responsible for the content or functionality of any supporting information supplied by the authors. Any queries (other than missing content) should be directed to the corresponding author for the article.,,0,2026,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
