40849928,Human Expertise in an AI-Collaborative Peer-Review Process,10.1188/25.ONF.316-317,,,,,,Janine A Overcash,W4413477949,"Recently, I assigned a peer-review exercise to my DNP students. One student turned in an unusual assignment. The review consisted of a summary with vague descriptors and language uncommon in academic writing. It also lacked a substantive critique of the methods and findings. I strongly suspect that artificial intelligence (AI) was used to complete the assignment, which, according to the syllabus, was not allowed. Not long after, I read an editorial stating that many peer reviews may be AI generated and are often not disclosed (Zou, 2024).",W4404072995; W4408922361,1,2025,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
