37590120,RETRACTED: Google Bard Artificial Intelligence vs the 2022 Self-Assessment Study Program for Urology,10.1097/UPJ.0000000000000453,,,,,,Linda My Huynh; Benjamin T. Bonebrake; Kaitlyn E. Schultis; Alan Quach; Christopher M. Deibert,W4385948288,"No AccessUrology PracticeResearch Letter17 Aug 2023Google Bard Artificial Intelligence versus the 2022 Self-Assessment Study Program for Urology Linda My Huynh, Benjamin T Bonebrake, Kaitlyn Schultis, Alan Quach, andMD Christopher M Deibert Linda My HuynhLinda My Huynh https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8655-8587 MD/PhD Scholars Program; University of Nebraska Medical Center, Omaha, NE , Benjamin T BonebrakeBenjamin T Bonebrake College of Medicine; University of Nebraska Medical Center, Omaha, NE , Kaitlyn SchultisKaitlyn Schultis College of Medicine; University of Nebraska Medical Center, Omaha, NE , Alan QuachAlan Quach Division of Urology, University of Nebraska Medical Center, Omaha, NE , and Christopher M DeibertChristopher M Deibert aAll correspondence to: Christopher Deibert Associate Professor Department of Surgery, Division of Urology University of Nebraska Medical Center 987521 Nebraska Medical Center Omaha, NE 68198-7521. Email: E-mail Address: [email protected] Division of Urology, University of Nebraska Medical Center, Omaha, NE View All Author Informationhttps://doi.org/10.1097/UPJ.0000000000000453AboutPDF ToolsAdd to favoritesDownload CitationsTrack Citations ShareFacebookLinked InTwitterEmail Copyright © 2023 by American Urological Association Education and Research, Inc. Unauthorized reproduction of this article is prohibited.FiguresReferencesRelatedDetails Advertisement Copyright & PermissionsCopyright © 2023 by American Urological Association Education and Research, Inc. Unauthorized reproduction of this article is prohibited.Keywordsmedical applicationurologylarge language modelartificial intelligenceMetrics Author Information Linda My Huynh MD/PhD Scholars Program; University of Nebraska Medical Center, Omaha, NE More articles by this author Benjamin T Bonebrake College of Medicine; University of Nebraska Medical Center, Omaha, NE More articles by this author Kaitlyn Schultis College of Medicine; University of Nebraska Medical Center, Omaha, NE More articles by this author Alan Quach Division of Urology, University of Nebraska Medical Center, Omaha, NE More articles by this author Christopher M Deibert Division of Urology, University of Nebraska Medical Center, Omaha, NE aAll correspondence to: Christopher Deibert Associate Professor Department of Surgery, Division of Urology University of Nebraska Medical Center 987521 Nebraska Medical Center Omaha, NE 68198-7521. Email: E-mail Address: [email protected] More articles by this author Expand All Advertisement PDF downloadLoading ...",,3,2023,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
