35834257,Artificial Intelligence and the Promise of Expediting and Standardizing the Reviewing and Reporting of Capsule Endoscopy Videos,10.1001/jamanetworkopen.2022.22006,,,,,,Michael Sai Lai Sey,W4285390492,"process, with consensus reached among a group of international experts with a high degree of agreement.5,6 Thus, it would be important to validate the algorithm against the new consensus definitions and retrain the algorithm if necessary.Furthermore, because the algorithm was derived in a single country and validated at a single center, it would be important to externally validate the algorithm with a more geographically diverse group of patients and capsule endoscopists.Ultimately, if the algorithm performs well in these scenarios, then AI-assisted review may become the new standard for capsule reporting.",W1650175677; W2016373942; W2918282796; W2997480534; W3021965851,2,2022,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
