3338902,The Role of Artificial Intelligence in Medical Imaging,10.1097/00004424-198801000-00014,,,,,,Steven E. Seltzer; Gary P. Zientara,W2056364220,"With this issue, Investigative Radiology unveils a new section entitled Current Concepts. The motivation for this feature arose from a realization that the last two decades have witnessed an explosion in the number of scientific disciplines directly relevant to radiology. Whereas in 1970 our scientific underpinnings were to a certain extent limited to radiation physics and radiation biology, in 1988 our discipline extends into areas ranging from supercomputers to superconductors. It has become encumbent on those working in radiology and the imaging sciences to keep abreast of research in these newly relevant and rapidly developing fields. To enhance our readers awareness of related disciplines, each Current Concepts section will contain a contribution from a prominent scientist representing one of more than two dozen science or engineering fields, as well as selected nonscience disciplines. These concise reviews of current research or current thinking will be directed at the interests of those in the imaging sciences and often will be supplemented by abstracts or references for further reading. To highlight the relevance and impact of these articles, an individual working in the imaging sciences will comment on each contribution. We hope you enjoy this new feature, and we solicit your comments and suggestions.",,2,1988,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
42738416,When Cancer Research Met Artificial Intelligence: From Machine Learning to Intelligent Oncology,10.3390/cancers18172896,,,,,,Daniele Giansanti,W7211869428,"Cancer research and artificial intelligence have developed from distinct scientific traditions, yet their trajectories are increasingly converging [...].",W2026036259; W2086243987; W4317781007; W4393094536; W4396636942; W4404328068; W4408119865; W4409040030; W4409912954; W4414277778; W4415016742; W7160848554; W7165764205,0,2026,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
