37726741,The challenges imposed by artificial intelligence: are we ready in medical education?,10.1186/s12909-023-04660-z,,,,,,Samy A. Azer; Anthony P. S. Guerrero,W4386847565,"Artificial intelligence (AI) is the science and engineering of making intelligent machines. In medical education, the usefulness of AI and its applications is being explored in training, learning, simulation, curriculum, and developing new assessment tools. This editorial encourages authors to submit their research on AI concerning medical education to enrich our knowledge.",W1997866278; W2269870390; W2937037822; W2951405082; W2963353367; W2995872180; W4280557200; W4309663439,56,2023,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
