32769462,On Artificial Intelligence and Deep Learning Within Medical Education,10.1097/ACM.0000000000003630,,,,,,Lawrence Carin,W3047629609,"The methodology of deep learning, a component of machine learning and artificial intelligence, is introduced. The opportunity for this technology to automate some aspects of medical practice is reviewed. Finally, a discussion is provided on the integration of concepts from deep learning into medical education.",W2018951189; W2040870580; W2724276442; W2804860796; W2889976627; W2892091703; W2919356958; W2939970150; W2974726644; W2981296841; W3004427117; W3013053228; W6754487060; W6754572519; W6760258393,58,2020,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
