39219791,Artificial intelligence in the transition of allergy: a valuable tool from childhood to adulthood,10.3389/fmed.2024.1469161,,,,,,Cristiana Indolfi; Angela Klain; Giulio Dinardo; Fabio Decimo; Michele Miraglia del Giudice,W4401622636,"Citation: Indolfi C, Klain A, Dinardo G, Decimo F and Miraglia del Giudice M (2024) Artificial intelligence in the transition of allergy: a valuable tool from childhood to adulthood. Front. Med. 11:1469161. doi: 10.3389/fmed.2024.1469161",W2624045457; W2736052867; W2758544228; W2908201961; W2981869278; W2985543011; W3036181646; W3036298167; W4295951577; W4376109347; W4385851665,5,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
