37268021,Dermatology in the wake of an AI revolution: Who gets a say?,10.1016/j.jaad.2023.05.053,,,,,,Eric J. Beltrami; Jane Margaret Grant-Kels,W4379011725,"To the Editor: We thank Ferreira and Lipoff for their response, which expands on salient ethical implications of artificial intelligence (AI) generated diagnoses in dermatology. Their insightful discussion raises additional ethical questions regarding patient autonomy, informed consent, and legal accountability as we look to a future in which AI and medicine coalesce.",W2959684014; W3025458042; W3198806597; W4364355594; W4376129499,3,2023,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
