37593091,Bone fracture detection—Can artificial intelligence replace doctors in orthopedic radiography analysis?,10.3389/frai.2023.1223909,,,,,,Aariz Hussain; Areeba Fareed; Shafaq Taseen,W4385457604,"OPINION article Front. Artif. Intell., 01 August 2023Sec. Medicine and Public Health Volume 6 - 2023 | https://doi.org/10.3389/frai.2023.1223909",W2166507657; W2888967035; W2946674875; W2969375211; W3003472476; W3178440138; W3215994836; W4200252844; W4283693809; W4296251976; W4303628264; W4311067900; W4377010595,13,2023,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
