38887862,RETRACTED: Artificial dermatitis versus artificial intelligence: Detecting etiology with Google Lens,10.1111/srt.13725,,,,,,Erhan Ayhan; Yusuf Alagöz,W4399788763,"Dear Editor,Artifact dermatitis is primarily a psychiatric disorder.The diagnosis can only be made after long and detailed investigations, as they do not recognize that they are the cause of the disease presentation.1 It is often difficult to find the action or the method.Sometimes it is possible to detect it by using a camera or a mirror. 2 Today, smartphones are a powerful scientific tool.However, there are studies using artificial intelligence-based smartphone applications that evaluate facial wrinkles, pores, pigmentation, acne profile.[3][4][5] But its potential is still",W2065272588; W2316232452; W3027038154; W4302597394; W4367320545; W4387974220; W4393942636; W6641125539,1,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
