41259077,Scientific Publishing in Times of Artificial Intelligence,10.11607/ijp.2025.6e,,,,,,Irena Sailer,W7116087171,"Scientific publishing has always evolved in tandem with technologic progress. From the printing press to digital submission systems, each innovation has reshaped how knowledge is created, disseminated, and evaluated. Today, we are at the threshold of another profound transformation: the integration of artificial intelligence (AI) into scholarly publishing.",,0,2025,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
