38604744,Revolutionizing oral pathology and medicine: The artificial intelligence advantage,10.1111/jop.13534,,,,,,Rishi Sanjay Ramani,W4394763689,The author declares no conflicts of interest. The peer review history for this article is available at https://www.webofscience.com/api/gateway/wos/peer-review/10.1111/jop.13534. The data that support the findings of this study are available from the corresponding author upon reasonable request.,W1482396279; W1596717185; W1963899414; W1985258161; W2062445844; W2112796928; W2911964244; W2919115771; W2974284079; W3023479251; W3044073403; W3047694265; W3107263686; W3130719814; W3131352164; W3133691987; W3137014685; W3171108477; W3174851702; W3208834934; W4236137412; W4283702612; W4318052317; W4381620840; W4382939037; W6607259140,0,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
