37140685,The potential and challenges of artificial intelligence and machine learning in the study of pain.,10.55563/clinexprheumatol/d3n8dc,,,,,,Peircarlo Sarzi-Puttini; Valeria Giorgi,W4368360283,"Clinical and Experimental Rheumatology 2023 Rheumatology Department, IRCCS Ospedale Galeazzi-Sant’Ambrogio, Milano, Italy. Piercarlo Sarzi-Puttini, MD Valeria Giorgi, MD Please address correspondence to: Valeria Giorgi Rheumatology Unit, IRCCS Galeazzi-Sant’Ambrogio, Via C. Belgioioso 173, 20157 Milano, Italy. E-mail: vale.gio@fastwebnet.it Received on February 6, 2023; accepted in revised form on February 28, 2023. Clin Exp Rheumatol 2023; 41: 1214-1215. © Copyright CliniCal and ExpErimEntal rhEumatology 2023.",W3094650117; W3106731524; W3193449606; W3196012986; W3197148688; W3203689742; W4226149246; W4316014106; W4319813813,2,2023,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
