34775712,[Value of artificial intelligence in the diagnosis and treatment of cardiovascular diseases].,10.3760/cma.j.cn112148-20210715-00594,,,,,,Ping Zhang,W3212431030,人工智能（AI）是指能够模拟人的某些思维过程和智能行为的技术或系统，经过65年的发展，AI技术发展迅速，尤其是近10年来，在医疗领域的应用更是突飞猛进。我国心血管疾病患病人数众多，心血管疾病领域对AI的需求与应用已经涉及多个方面，在心血管疾病的早期筛查、自动诊断、危险分层等方面展现出独特优势，该文就AI辅助心血管疾病诊断与治疗的研究进展进行总结，为我国心血管疾病防控提供参考。.,,0,2021,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
34743331,Should we be guinea pigs for Google’s artificial intelligence app?,10.1111/ijd.15976,,,,,,Mara Giavina‐Bianchi,W3211729465,"been reported as ARPC etiologies. All six patients with the giant variant of ARPC complained of severe pruritus, and five had DM. In our patient, in addition to DM, frequent scratching due to pruritus and S. aureus infection might have played a role in the development of unusually large eruptions. While topical corticosteroids and oral antihistamines have limited effects on pruritus, the additional use of NB-UVB phototherapy reduced pruritus and improved skin eruptions. NB-UVB phototherapy is thought to decrease proinflammatory cytokine levels and induce mast cell apoptosis, which might contribute to reduce inflammation and pruritus. NB-UVB phototherapy could be the favorable choice of treatment not only for usual ARPC but also for giant variants of ARPC.",W3025011581; W3036298167; W3083037565; W3083992516; W3105070630; W3136552952; W3159814022,0,2022,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
