25515486,Leave it to Florence,10.7748/ns.29.16.63.s48,,,,,,Jane Whyatt,W2485530817,"There are four practice nurses at Heatherlands Medical Centre in Woodchurch, Cheshire--and one 'intelligent system' named Florence. With a voice like a car satnav, 'she' is a software robot, or Artificial Intelligence (AI).",,0,2014,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
