39169244,The testing of AI in medicine is a mess. Here’s how it should be done,10.1038/d41586-024-02675-0,,,,,,Mariana Lenharo,W4401760113,"Hundreds of medical algorithms have been approved on basis of limited clinical data, but who should test these tools and how best to do it is debated.",W3006079219; W3088361296; W3136960503; W3159560336; W4220918265; W4280516220; W4387439404; W4392058364,32,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
