37526254,Artifical intelligence use in orthopedics: an ethical point of view,10.1530/EOR-23-0083,,,,,,Elcil Kaya Biçer; Heiner Fangerau; Hakkı Sur,W4385442255,"Artificial intelligence (AI) is increasingly being utilized in orthopedics practice. Ethical concerns have arisen alongside marked improvements and widespread utilization of AI. Patient privacy, consent, data protection, cybersecurity, data safety and monitoring, bias, and accountability are some of the ethical concerns.",W2095533277; W2100034971; W2143079363; W2595962374; W2735575534; W2738975713; W2808184318; W2924551358; W2946267603; W2995435724; W2995887567; W3004889343; W3110784362; W3128929179; W3129147606; W3129275189; W3158651856; W3163849331; W3165668116; W3199664458; W3215576526; W4225262638; W4229660542; W4241074102; W4241671229; W4243392022; W4253523621,37,2023,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
39328370,Responsible application of artificial intelligence in health care,10.17159/sajs.2023/14889,,,,,,Adetayo Emmanuel Obasa; Andrea C. Palk,W4378576439,"The responsible application of artificial intelligence (AI) in health care is crucial as it has the potential to revolutionise medical practices.AI technologies can analyse medical data, identify patterns, and generate insights that can inform clinical decision-making, improve patient outcomes, and reduce healthcare costs.However, the ethical, legal, and social implications of AI in health care must be considered to ensure that its implementation is safe, transparent, and equitable.It is essential to prioritise the responsible application of these technologies to maximise their benefits and minimise potential harm.As AI continues to advance, its responsible application will play a vital role in shaping the future of health care.",W1898928487; W2087710120; W2168610667; W2334912947; W2558050786; W2777794149; W2794518994; W2889037799; W2895763047; W2905657479; W2908201961; W2915292867; W2953522645; W3018070193; W3035885149; W3147517805; W3160005967; W4206566227; W4206708370,15,2023,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
