12192400,Artificial intelligence: fast hands-free writing by gaze direction.,10.1038/418838a,,,,,,David James Ward; David Mackay,W1563141555,"Here we describe a method for text entry based on inverse arithmetic coding that relies on gaze direction alone and which is faster and more accurate than using an on-screen keyboard. These benefits are derived from two innovations: the writing task is matched to the capabilities of the eye, and a language model is used to make predictable words and phrases easier to write.",W1995875735; W2129652681; W2161628678; W2297622610,214,2002,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
