37097867,Why Canada’s Artificial Intelligence and Data Act Needs “Mental Data”,10.1080/21507740.2023.2188302,,,,,,Dylan White; Joshua August Skorburg,W4366982164,"By introducing the concept of “mental data,” Palermos (2023) highlights an underappreciated aspect of data ethics that policymakers would do well to heed. Sweeping artificial intelligence (AI) legi...",W2561262129; W2586119155; W2782798323; W2808052438; W3123725931; W3213313403; W4312019288; W4391097402,3,2023,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
