29254765,"On the Fuzziness of Machine Learning, Neural Networks, and Artificial Intelligence in Radiation Oncology.",10.1016/j.ijrobp.2017.06.011,,,,,,Issam El Naqa; Kristy Brock; Yan Yu; Katja Langen; Eric E. Klein,W2773345434,"This Oncology Scan highlights modern application of machine learning in the challenging areas of predicting radiation pneumonitis events after stereotactic body radiation therapy (SBRT) using boosting techniques, brain image segmentation with deep learning methods, and predicting toxicity using computed tomography radiomics with fuzzy logic.",W2037171241; W2067794541; W2084220915; W2087676836; W2096945460; W2117539524; W2128625986; W2132809551; W2161673710; W2188183693; W2207540049; W2332066482; W2412431176; W2417131376; W2496177076; W2555360349; W2591214870; W2595534055; W2919115771; W3104258355,21,2018,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
