38508683,Quality and safety of artificial intelligence generated health information,10.1136/bmj.q596,,,,,,Michael Joseph Sorich; Bradley Douglas Menz; Ashley Mark Hopkins,W4393054062,"Generative artificial intelligence (AI) is advancing rapidly and has the potential to greatly improve many aspects of society, including health. The risks of potentially harmful consequences, however, necessitate effective oversight and mitigation measures. This article highlights distinct forms of health related risks of generative AI, with corresponding options for mitigating risk.",W2972749265; W4321436564; W4361289889; W4383346782; W4388627527; W4389917881; W4392162396; W4393054030,40,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
