23341554,Profile of Michael I. Jordan,10.1073/pnas.1222664110,,,,,,Nicholette Zeliadt,W1973295279,"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences (PNAS), a peer reviewed journal of the National Academy of Sciences (NAS) - an authoritative source of high-impact, original research that broadly spans the biological, physical, and social sciences.",W1516111018; W1880262756; W1971886065; W1974670706; W2012696487; W2032139276; W2039201033; W2078807391; W2096503903; W2098127859; W2107674477; W2114221884; W2127429927; W2141590350; W2150090955; W2900914126; W4231510805; W6639619044,0,2013,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
10396251,Artificial intelligence for clinicians,10.1177/014107689909200302,,,,,,P J Drew; J R T Monson,W1916504560,,W96751186; W138464449; W166169566; W313369389; W1591346633; W1644997609; W1967900900; W1971974040; W1975328618; W1977804883; W1980485115; W1981811518; W1991396797; W1992087514; W1993955907; W1998110577; W2020870533; W2043937174; W2056577131; W2098787760; W2101902069; W2123715374; W2128718068; W2140218006; W2156133368; W2169472609; W2803544868; W3133765915,7,1999,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
