38775011,Artificial Intelligence in Cancer Clinical Research: II. Development and Validation of Clinical Prediction Models,10.1080/07357907.2024.2354991,,,,,,Gary H. Lyman; Nicole M. Kuderer,W4398212513,"In the first segment of this series on Artificial Intelligence in Cancer Clinical Research, we approached the subject first by developing a better understanding of human intelligence (1). The goals...",W2092931112; W2913997948; W2981869278; W2988716771; W3173574091; W3180959755; W3207434859; W4200191097; W4220708172; W4223540626; W4233026002; W4284888208; W4289778980; W4306689909; W4309944697; W4313495080; W4324308124; W4327748010; W4362636489; W4376118166; W4386624058; W4388209589; W4392800721; W4393386222; W4394845024; W4394857110; W4396592407; W4396779372,6,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
