40557377,First demonstration of left bundle branch area pacemaker implantation guided by artificial intelligence electrocardiographic mapping,10.1016/j.hrcr.2025.03.001,,,,,,Omar Mahmoud Aldaas; Erin Nicole Dreessens; Jonathan Chong Hsu; Ulrika Maria Birgersdotter-Green; Gordon Ho; David E. Krummen,W4408349898,• We describe a case of a patient with severe contrast allergy and chronic kidney disease who presented for left bundle branch area pacemaker implantation • We demonstrate the first use of forward-solution ECG mapping to guide the implantation of the left bundle branch area pacemaker lead • We were able to achieve left bundle branch area pacemaker implantation without the use of contrast and with reduced need for fluoroscopic imaging during LBBAP lead positioning on the right ventricular septum,W2794003858; W2950614089; W2995499612; W3048421131; W3087499493; W3119843763; W3202110148; W4220964716; W4226002934; W4294869288; W4377142171; W4392304007; W4392466745; W4405950284,0,2025,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
