37703426,"Response to: ""The next paradigm shift? ChatGPT, artificial intelligence, and medical education""",10.1080/0142159X.2023.2256961,,,,,,Li Feng Tan; Jonathan Jun Yi Heng; Desmond Boon Seng Teo,W4386699094,Dear EditorWe read the paper by Wang et al. (2023) with interest. We agree that while ChatGPT and other artificial intelligence – powered large language models (LLMs) will change the medical educat...,W4323920689; W4362734502; W4363645798; W4383371446; W4384665085,9,2023,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
