38534192,Artificial Intelligence in Breast Imaging Daily Clinical Practice: Counterpoint—Proceed With Caution,10.2214/AJR.24.30962,,,,,,Lisa Ann Mullen; Emily B. Ambinder,W4393223405,"Counterpoint-Proceed With CautionArtificial intelligence (AI) has the potential to enhance the daily clinical practice of breast imaging, including improvement in performance metrics, risk prediction, workflows, and efficiency.However, breast imaging practices and radiologists should understand the many challenges related to the clinical implementation and use of AI that require careful consideration. Please see the corresponding Point by Gastounioti and Kontos in this issue:",W4229036772; W4297242158; W4307777113; W4360811013; W4382562052; W4391109191,1,2024,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Asano-original-simplified.csv
